
---
const stages = [
  {
    number: "01",
    title: "Observe",
    subtitle: "Find what matters.",
    description: "We pay attention to everyday problems, changing environments, and questions that deserve a closer look."
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    title: "Explore",
    subtitle: "Understand the possibilities.",
    description: "We investigate unfamiliar fields, connect information, and look for opportunities beyond the obvious."
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    title: "Experiment",
    subtitle: "Learn by testing.",
    description: "We turn assumptions into small experiments. We build prototypes, test ideas, and learn from what happens."
  },
  {
    number: "04",
    title: "Build",
    subtitle: "Make ideas tangible.",
    description: "We develop useful products and services, focusing on real problems and practical value."
  },
  {
    number: "05",
    title: "Evolve",
    subtitle: "Keep moving forward.",
    description: "We listen, measure, improve, and allow each project to grow in a direction shaped by what we learn."
  }
];
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Our Approach — SAEO LABS</title>
  <meta name="description" content="How SAEO LABS explores ideas, experiments, and builds products." />
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a class="logo" href="/">SAEO LABS<span>®</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/about">ABOUT</a>
      <a href="/ventures">VENTURES</a>
      <a class="active" href="/approach">APPROACH</a>
      <a href="/#contact">CONTACT</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">SAEO LABS / OUR APPROACH</p>
      <h1>We learn by<br />moving forward<span>.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro">
        We don't expect every idea to begin with a perfect plan.
        We believe clarity comes through exploration, experimentation,
        and the process of making things real.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-note">
        A FLEXIBLE PROCESS FOR AN EVER-CHANGING WORLD.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="statement">
      <div class="section-label">01 / THE PRINCIPLE</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Start with a question.<br />Discover the next step.</h2>
        <p>
          Not everything needs to be figured out before we begin.
          Sometimes the best way to understand a problem is to work
          on it, test an idea, and see what becomes possible.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="process">
      <div class="section-label">02 / THE PROCESS</div>
      <div class="process-list">
        {stages.map((stage) => (
          <article class="stage">
            <span class="number">{stage.number}</span>
            <div class="stage-content">
              <p class="subtitle">{stage.subtitle}</p>
              <h3>{stage.title}</h3>
              <p class="description">{stage.description}</p>
            </div>
            <span class="arrow">↗</span>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="experiment">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / CONTINUOUS DISCOVERY</p>
      <h2>Progress doesn't<br />always move in a straight line<span>.</span></h2>
      <p>
        Some ideas become products. Some experiments lead to entirely
        different questions. Some directions change along the way.
        We see these outcomes as part of the process, not as interruptions.
      </p>
      <div class="keywords">
        <span>QUESTION</span>
        <span>DISCOVER</span>
        <span>TEST</span>
        <span>LEARN</span>
        <span>REPEAT</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing">
      <h2>Make room<br />for what matters<span>.</span></h2>
      <a href="/ventures">EXPLORE OUR VENTURES ↗</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>SAEO LABS © 2026</span>
    <a href="/">BACK TO HOME ↑</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f7f6f2;
    color: #25242a;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }

  header {
    height: 82px;
    padding: 0 7%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e3dc;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #25242a;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .logo span {
    color: #8061c8;
    font-size: 10px;
    vertical-align: top;
    margin-left: 3px;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  nav a, footer a {
    color: #77747c;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  nav a.active, nav a:hover {
    color: #8061c8;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 0 7%;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 120px 0 100px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e3dc;
  }

  .eyebrow, .section-label {
    color: #8061c8;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 94px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
    margin: 35px 0;
  }

  h1 span, h2 span {
    color: #8061c8;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 540px;
    color: #77747c;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .hero-note {
    margin-top: 65px;
    color: #aaa5ae;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .statement, .process {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 50px;
    padding: 95px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e3dc;
  }

  .section-label {
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  .statement h2, .experiment h2, .closing h2 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px);
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1.16;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
  }

  .statement p:not(.section-label), .experiment p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 570px;
    color: #77747c;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .process-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stage {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 55px 1fr 30px;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 30px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e6e3dc;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .number {
    color: #8061c8;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding-top: 8px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: #aaa5ae;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .stage h3 {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .description {
    color: #77747c;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 570px;
  }

  .arrow {
    color: #8061c8;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .experiment {
    padding: 110px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e3dc;
  }

  .experiment h2 {
    margin: 30px 0;
  }

  .keywords {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 55px;
  }

  .keywords span {
    border: 1px solid #ded9e6;
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 11px 17px;
    color: #8061c8;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .closing {
    padding: 100px 0;
  }

  .closing a {
    color: #8061c8;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #e6e3dc;
    padding: 30px 7%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: #aaa5ae;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    header {
      height: auto;
      min-height: 75px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px 6%;
    }

    nav {
      gap: 17px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    main {
      padding: 0 6%;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    h1 {
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .statement, .process {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 65px 0;
    }

    .stage {
      grid-template-columns: 35px 1fr 20px;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .experiment {
      padding: 75px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
